   "he": "וּפֶסַח דּוֹרוֹת נוֹהֵג כׇּל שִׁבְעָה וְכוּ׳. אַמַּאי קָאֵי? אִי לֵימָא אַפֶּסַח, פֶּסַח כׇּל שִׁבְעָה מִי אִיכָּא!",
   "en": "The mishna stated that «the Paschal lamb of» later «generations applies all seven» days. The Gemara asks: «On what does this stand? If we say» that it refers «to the Paschal lamb» itself, «is there a Paschal lamb all seven» days? It is offered only on the fourteenth of Nisan."
  }
